About WILLY
-----------

WILLY is a platform style game. Help Willy to collect all keys of a
screen and join the door to access the other screens.
On line Help gives more information about how to play.



Installation
------------

- Copy the file Willy.opa to your \APP\ directory
- Create a new directory called WILLY in your \APP\ directory, 
  and copy the files screens.opo and willy.pic to the
  \APP\WILLY directory on the Psion.
- If you want to use the sound option,
  copy the wve files form the WVE directory of the distibution
  package to any \WVE\ directory on your Psion.

Use psion-I to install WILLY as usual.

WILLY will also create several files in the \OPD\ directory of the
internal disk.

Distribution
