THIS PROGRAM COMES WITH NO WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT WILL THE
COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES RESULTING FROM THE USE OF
THIS PROGRAM.

This program is shareware. You can try it freely, but if you continue
to use it you must register. The shareware version is fully
functioning, with the only nuisance of "nag" screens.

To register, send UKP 10 (or equivalent in cash in any major
currencies) to the following address :

Didier Pirottin
Rue des Beguines 5
4600 Vise
Belgium

IF YOU HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, please send it to me and I will send
your code by email.

IF YOU DON'T HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, DON'T FORGET to send me a self
addressed envelope, so I can mail your registration code.

When you receive your code, you just have to enter it (press Psion-G
during a game). This will create a file Willy.reg in the M:\OPD\
directory, and disable all nag screens.

ALL COMMENTS ABOUT THE GAME AND BUG REPORTS ARE ALSO *VERY* WELCOME.
Please email to : pirottin@montefiore.ulg.ac.be

Future Work
-----------

I plan to write new Willy's adventures (new screens.opo files which can
